# Forms (default — never remove)

All forms use **one customized, unified** Tailwind-styled system (`ui-styling.mdc`). No bare browser defaults.

## Required controls

| Control | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Label | Tied to control; `text-sm font-medium`; required marker consistent |
| Text / textbox | Shared h-10 (or token), radius, border, focus ring |
| Email | Same chrome + email validation UX |
| Tel | Same chrome; optional shared formatting |
| Password | **Show / hide** toggle; same chrome as text |
| Search | Clear action when value present |
| Select | Custom select matching input metrics |
| Checkbox | Custom box + full label hit target |
| **Radio** | Custom radio group; one selection; keyboard navigable |
| **Slider / slide** | Range input styled to theme; min/max/step; value label optional |
| Picker | Date/time/datetime — same tokens as inputs; popover calendar ok |
| Stepper | − / value / + with min, max, step |
| Editor | Multiline / rich text — shared border, focus, error |
| Upload | Photo/file — preview, remove, type/size errors |
| Button | Primary / secondary / ghost / danger; **text**, **icon**, **icon+text** |
| Link `a` | Brand link tokens; not default browser blue |

## Styling (locked with ui-styling)

- One token set: height, radius, border, focus ring, error, success, disabled, placeholder
- Error text: `text-sm text-danger` below field; `aria-invalid` + describedby
- Keyboard + screen-reader accessible
- Shared `components/ui/` — compose Tailwind utilities into primitives
- Icon-only buttons: `aria-label` required

## Do not

- Mix native unstyled inputs with custom form chrome on the same form
- One-off field heights or colors outside theme
- Skip radio/slider when the concept needs them — still use shared styling

See also: `ui-styling.mdc`, `validation.mdc`. Advanced: `forms-advanced.mdc`, `ui-styling-advanced.mdc`.
